<span id="A3.T11.2.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">I Can’t Help Myself (Sugar Pie Honey Bunch). chart in 1989. The "Motorcity All-Stars" released a rerecorded version of song in 1989 on Ian Levine’s Motown revival label Motorcity.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T11.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A3.T11.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row"><span id="A3.T11.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Translated</span></th>
